{"_id":"68a736128ec3d8323af14b97","nodeId":"w3cfuNC-IdUKA7CEXs0fT","roadmapSlug":"data-engineer","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:06:58.672Z","description":"# Data Engineering Lifecycle\n\nThe data engineering lifecycle describes the stages data moves through from creation to consumption. These stages typically include generation, ingestion, storage, transformation, and serving. Each stage has its own tools, failure modes, and design considerations. Understanding the full lifecycle helps engineers make better decisions about architecture and tooling.","resources":[{"type":"book","title":"Fundamentals of Data Engineering","url":"https://www.oreilly.com/library/view/fundamentals-of-data/9781098108298/","_id":"6a7f4a42cb44947debcf5330"},{"type":"article","title":"Data Engineering Lifecycle","url":"https://medium.com/towards-data-engineering/data-engineering-lifecycle-d1e7ee81632e","_id":"6a7f4a42cb44947debcf5331"},{"type":"video","title":"Getting Into Data Engineering","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hZu_87l62J4","_id":"6a7f4a42cb44947debcf5332"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:02:58.294Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e04e1fb5fcb94d0417044","title":"DataCamp - Associate Data Engineer in SQL","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/WOP6XG"},{"_id":"6a5e04e1fb5fcb94d0417100","title":"DataCamp - Data Engineer in Python","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/JkYLbr"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/data-engineer/content/w3cfuNC-IdUKA7CEXs0fT.md"}